      "english": "I showed everyone the results of my practice.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20927_hirousuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{結婚式|けっこんしき}の{披露宴|ひろうえん}で{二人|ふたり}は{幸|しあわ}せそうにダンスを{披露|ひろう}した。",
      "english": "At the wedding reception, the couple happily performed a dance.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
